{
  "sourceLanguage": "fr",
  "strings": {
    "Accueil": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activation": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Setup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activer **Avert**": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on **Avert**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune donnée de page ne quitte l'appareil": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No page data leaves the device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune donnée de page ne quitte votre appareil": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No page data leaves your device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune liste noire. Aucun réseau. Une comparaison.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No blocklist. No network. One comparison."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune requête réseau, même pour vérifier une marque": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No network request, not even to check a brand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune télémétrie, aucun compte": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No telemetry, no account"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aucune télémétrie, aucun compte, aucune publicité": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No telemetry, no account, no ads"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Autoriser sur tous les sites (« Toujours autoriser »)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow on every website (“Always Allow”)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avert analyse les pages localement. Aucune adresse, aucun contenu n'est envoyé où que ce soit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avert analyses pages locally. No address, no content is sent anywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avert explique et ralentit. Il ne bloque pas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avert explains and slows you down. It does not block."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avert ne peut pas savoir si vous avez fait ces trois étapes : rien ne remonte de Safari vers l'app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avert can't tell whether you've done these three steps: nothing travels back from Safari to the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avert réduit un risque, il ne l'élimine pas. Vous restez la dernière ligne de défense.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avert reduces a risk, it does not remove it. You remain the last line of defence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avert vit dans Safari. Trois réglages à faire une fois :": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avert lives inside Safari. Three settings, once:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caractères trompeurs, marque greffée sur un domaine étranger, structure inhabituelle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deceptive characters, a brand grafted onto a foreign domain, unusual structure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ce que je ne vois pas": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What I can't see"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certaines techniques (formulaires reconstruits en image, protections avancées) échappent à mon analyse. Une absence d'alerte ne garantit rien.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some techniques (forms rebuilt as images, advanced protections) escape my analysis. The absence of a warning guarantees nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Certains prestataires d'authentification légitimes ressemblent à une incohérence d'identité. Une alerte reste toujours contournable — c'est vous qui décidez.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some legitimate authentication providers look exactly like an identity mismatch. A warning can always be dismissed — you decide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cette page ment-elle sur son identité ?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Is this page lying about who it is?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Champ caché, formulaire qui poste ailleurs, logo emprunté à une marque connue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hidden field, form posting elsewhere, logo borrowed from a known brand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comment ça marche": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How it works"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confidentialité": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jamais d'alerte sur un seul indice": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never a warning on a single clue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne connais qu'une liste de marques (banques, services). Face à une marque absente, je ne peux comparer aucune identité — seulement repérer des schémas d'arnaque génériques.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I only know a list of brands (banks, services). Faced with a brand that isn't on it, I have no identity to compare — only generic scam patterns to spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vois pas tout d'une page": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't see everything on a page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vois que Safari": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I only see Safari"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je ne vérifie ni le certificat ni l'âge du domaine": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I check neither the certificate nor the domain's age"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je peux me tromper (faux positif)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can be wrong (false positive)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'adresse est examinée": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address is examined"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'identité revendiquée est extraite": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The claimed identity is extracted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La page est examinée": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The page is examined"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le modèle sur l'appareil dit quelle marque la page prétend être. Avert compare — et c'est cette comparaison qui décide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The on-device model says which brand the page claims to be. Avert compares — and that comparison is what decides."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le phishing s'adapte plus vite qu'une défense. Je croise plusieurs indices pour rendre l'évasion coûteuse, pas impossible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phishing adapts faster than any defence. I cross several clues to make evasion expensive, not impossible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le pire échec possible pour un outil comme Avert n'est pas de rater un site : c'est de vous faire croire que vous êtes couvert. Ce que je ne sais pas faire est écrit ici, pas caché dans une page d'aide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The worst possible failure for a tool like Avert isn't missing a site: it's making you believe you're covered. What it can't do is written here, not buried in a help page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limites": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limits"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mot de passe, carte, code, phrase de récupération : c'est le seul moment où l'analyse démarre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password, card, code, recovery phrase: that is the only moment analysis starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ouvrir les Réglages": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pas de badge, pas de score, pas de « page sûre ». Une alerte veut dire quelque chose parce qu'elle est rare.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No badge, no score, no “this page is safe”. A warning means something because it is rare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plusieurs signaux doivent converger, et une alerte forte exige en plus une incohérence d'identité confirmée.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Several signals have to converge, and a strong warning also requires a confirmed identity mismatch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Politique de confidentialité": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy policy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pourquoi cet écran existe": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Why this screen exists"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rien ne s'affiche sur une page normale": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing appears on an ordinary page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Réglages": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Réglages → Apps → Safari → Extensions": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings → Apps → Safari → Extensions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Safari ne me donne pas accès à ces informations sans réseau. Je m'appuie sur l'identité revendiquée et la structure de la page, pas sur la réputation du domaine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safari gives me no access to that without the network. I rely on the claimed identity and the page's structure, not on the domain's reputation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silence par défaut": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silent by default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un attaquant qui m'étudie peut me contourner": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An attacker who studies me can work around me"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un lien ouvert dans une autre app, un SMS, un mail, un QR code : hors de ma portée jusqu'à ce que la page s'ouvre dans Safari.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A link opened in another app, a text, an email, a QR code: out of my reach until the page opens in Safari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Une marque hors de mon registre n'est pas vérifiable": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A brand outside my registry can't be verified"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Une page demande un secret": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A page asks for a secret"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vous pouvez toujours continuer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can always continue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.caveat": {
      "comment": "Toujours affiché, quel que soit le verdict. Ne jamais retirer.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I only read the address, not the page. A clean address does not make a page honest."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je n'ai lu que l'adresse, pas la page. Une adresse propre ne garantit pas une page honnête."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.detail.impersonation": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = marque, %2$@ = hôte réel.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link evokes “%1$@” but leads to %2$@, which does not belong to that brand. Do not enter any credentials there."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le lien évoque « %1$@ » mais mène à %2$@, qui n'appartient pas à cette marque. N'y saisissez aucun identifiant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.detail.nothing": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = hôte.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address %1$@ shows no sign of impersonation that I can recognise."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'adresse %1$@ ne présente aucun signe d'usurpation d'identité que je sache reconnaître."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.detail.suspicious": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = hôte.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address %1$@ shows traits common to phishing pages, without certainty."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'adresse %1$@ présente des caractéristiques fréquentes sur les pages de phishing, sans certitude."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.error.not-a-link": {
      "comment": "Entrée qui n'est pas un lien web (mailto:, texte brut).",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is not a web link"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n'est pas un lien web"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.error.not-a-link.detail": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can only check http or https addresses."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ne sais vérifier que des adresses http ou https."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.headline.impersonation": {
      "comment": "Verdict d'un lien vérifié hors du navigateur. %1$@ = marque imitée.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This address imitates “%1$@”"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse imite « %1$@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.headline.nothing": {
      "comment": "Verdict d'un lien : rien trouvé DANS L'ADRESSE. Jamais « sûr ».",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing unusual in the address"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien d'anormal dans l'adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.headline.suspicious": {
      "comment": "Verdict d'un lien : indices présents mais non concluants.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unusual address"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adresse inhabituelle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.brand-subdomain": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = marque, %2$@ = hôte.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” placed as a subdomain of another domain (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« %1$@ » placé en sous-domaine d'un autre domaine (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.combosquat": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = marque, %2$@ = détail.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brand name “%1$@” glued to a lure word (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nom de marque « %1$@ » collé à un mot d'appât (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.exotic-port": {
      "comment": "%2$@ = port.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unusual network port (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port réseau inhabituel (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.homograph": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = marque, %2$@ = détail.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deceptive characters imitating “%1$@” (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caractères trompeurs imitant « %1$@ » (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.ip-literal": {
      "comment": "%2$@ = hôte.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP address instead of a domain name (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adresse IP au lieu d'un nom de domaine (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.low-rep-tld": {
      "comment": "%2$@ = extension.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Domain extension often used by throwaway sites (.%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extension de domaine souvent utilisée par des sites jetables (.%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.mixed-script": {
      "comment": "%2$@ = hôte décodé.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Several alphabets mixed in the domain (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plusieurs alphabets mélangés dans le domaine (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.punycode": {
      "comment": "%2$@ = forme décodée.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Address encoded to hide non-Latin characters (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adresse encodée pour masquer des caractères non latins (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.subdomain-depth": {
      "comment": "%2$@ = nombre de niveaux.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deeply nested subdomains (%2$@ levels)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sous-domaines très imbriqués (%2$@ niveaux)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "link.signal.l1.typosquat": {
      "comment": "%1$@ = marque, %2$@ = détail.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spelling very close to “%1$@” (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orthographe très proche de « %1$@ » (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "verdict.reason.brand-mismatch": {
